notes: 'JCM 574 combines 16.6 ml of this 1 M KH2PO4 solution with 83.4 ml of a distinct
  1 M K2HPO4 solution and then an equal volume of distilled water. Stock carrier and
  supplied solid hydrate are not specified; do not treat that later dilution water
  as the stock solvent. JCM 1181 explicitly imports this buffer. Raw case labels remain
  only in evidence and case-bound proposal links, not globally resolving synonyms.
  No occurrence count transfer, source-hold release or receiving-medium dose correction
  is implied. Issue 1227 source-relative completeness: JCM 574 potassium phosphate
  buffer combines 16.6 ml of 1 M KH2PO4 with 83.4 ml of 1 M K2HPO4 and an equal volume
  of water. The individual KH2PO4 stock carrier and hydration are unspecified. UNKNOWN
  denotes unstated source closure; no carrier is invented and no particular omitted
  ingredient is asserted.'
